      "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:36:10.937Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you want to update the same invoice after submitting, you have to edit it via database.<br>\nVersioning is the way to protect data integrity. You don’t want your employee send $1000 invoice to your customer, and edit it to $100 afterward so they can pocket the difference, don’t you?</p>",
